      "report_date": "2026-11-26",
      "title": "SYS010 Reloaded: The new malvertising campaign targeting Meta Business Accounts",
      "summary": "SYS010 is a malvertising campaign that uses Meta ads promoting free animated wallpaper software to target Meta Business accounts, identified by Bitdefender Labs and assessed as a second major version of the SYS01 operation. Victims download a working wallpaper application that secretly installs a PHP loader, which enrolls the machine with a command-and-control server and delivers later stages only to selected victims. The final payload is a malicious browser extension for Chrome, Edge and Firefox that steals cookies, collects Facebook ad account and Business Manager data, and can read and delete emails, including security alerts. Browsers are enrolled into attacker-controlled management consoles, making the extensions hard for users to remove. Bitdefender advises never downloading software from social media ads, treating unexpected \"managed by your organization\" messages as possible compromise, and protecting the email account linked to Meta assets.",
      "completeness": "Medium",
